<title>FRANCE: French budget to be officially presented Sept 18.</title>
<headline>French budget to be officially presented Sept 18.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>France's 1997 budget will be presented officially to the government at a cabinet meeting on September 18, a government official said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Prime Minister Alain Juppe will however present the main outlines of the government's plans beforehand. He said last week this would be around September 10, though no exact date has been fixed.</p>
<p>The government is currently finalising plans to reform taxes and social security charges and putting the final touches to the 1997 budget.</p>
</text>
